  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"body markup\" dir=\"auto\">\n   <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n    <figure>\n     <a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://youtu.be/KzS5Qs7vSMg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"> \n      <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n       <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101210247_6eb2cce3-63b0-4bbe-bd95-7e21efd9b99a_1920x1080.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101210247_6eb2cce3-63b0-4bbe-bd95-7e21efd9b99a_1920x1080.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101210247_6eb2cce3-63b0-4bbe-bd95-7e21efd9b99a_1920x1080.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101210247_6eb2cce3-63b0-4bbe-bd95-7e21efd9b99a_1920x1080.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101210247_6eb2cce3-63b0-4bbe-bd95-7e21efd9b99a_1920x1080.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6eb2cce3-63b0-4bbe-bd95-7e21efd9b99a_1920x1080.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:819,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:2052810,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://youtu.be/KzS5Qs7vSMg&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.lennysnewsletter.com/i/222540764?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6eb2cce3-63b0-4bbe-bd95-7e21efd9b99a_1920x1080.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101210247_6eb2cce3-63b0-4bbe-bd95-7e21efd9b99a_1920x1080.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101210247_6eb2cce3-63b0-4bbe-bd95-7e21efd9b99a_1920x1080.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101210247_6eb2cce3-63b0-4bbe-bd95-7e21efd9b99a_1920x1080.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261101210247_6eb2cce3-63b0-4bbe-bd95-7e21efd9b99a_1920x1080.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture>\n       <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n         <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"> \n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\">\n           <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n          </svg> \n         </button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div> \n     </a>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n   <p><strong>Hector Serrano</strong><span> runs one of the most innovative and successful paid growth programs in Silicon Valley. As Head of Content at Wispr Flow, a leading AI voice-to-text tool, he built a roster of 50 creators who drive 500 to 600 paid user-generated content (UGC) ads every month. The creators are paid a cut of ad spend, and the best of them earn over $13,000 a month. It’s a playbook the best DTC brands have used for years, now adapted for SaaS. Hector joined Wispr Flow at 19, before the product had PMF, and over the past year, Wispr Flow has grown revenue 30x and raised at a $2 billion valuation.</span></p>\n   <div class=\"pullquote\">\n    <p><strong><span>Listen on </span><a href=\"https://youtu.be/KzS5Qs7vSMg\">YouTube</a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/79YWurAzra94dVJpD3H9uS\">Spotify</a><span>, or </span><a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-a-19-year-old-intern-built-the-growth-engine/id1627920305?i=1000799224596\">Apple Podcasts</a></strong></p>\n   </div>\n   <h3 class=\"header-anchor-post\">We discuss:\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\">\n      <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft iconButton-mq_Et5 iconButtonBase-dJGHgN buttonBase-GK1x3M buttonStyle-r7yGCK size_sm-G3LciD priority_secondary-S63h9o\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" data-href=\"https://www.lennysnewsletter.com/i/222540764/we-discuss\"> \n       <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link\">\n        <path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path>\n       </svg> \n      </button>\n     </div>\n    </div></h3>\n   <ol>\n    <li>\n     <p>Why paid UGC is one of the biggest untapped growth levers right now</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n     <p>The step-by-step playbook for building a successful paid-UGC program</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n     <p>Why the best marketers are “allergic to AI”</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n     <p>What makes a great modern marketing hire</p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n     <p>Why YouTube is the most underrated growth lever in SaaS</p>\n    </li>\n   </ol>\n   <div class=\"callout-block\" data-callout=\"true\">\n    <h3>Brought to you by:</h3>\n    <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n     <figure>\n      <div class=\"image-link image2 can-restack\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\">\n       <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n        <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261018124643_6af03b0a-8082-47c0-ac65-43291f55e5d8_1974x248.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261018124643_6af03b0a-8082-47c0-ac65-43291f55e5d8_1974x248.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261018124643_6af03b0a-8082-47c0-ac65-43291f55e5d8_1974x248.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261018124643_6af03b0a-8082-47c0-ac65-43291f55e5d8_1974x248.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261018124643_6af03b0a-8082-47c0-ac65-43291f55e5d8_1974x248.png\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6af03b0a-8082-47c0-ac65-43291f55e5d8_1974x248.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:183,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:16842,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.lennysnewsletter.com/i/216929530?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6af03b0a-8082-47c0-ac65-43291f55e5d8_1974x248.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261018124643_6af03b0a-8082-47c0-ac65-43291f55e5d8_1974x248.png 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261018124643_6af03b0a-8082-47c0-ac65-43291f55e5d8_1974x248.png 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261018124643_6af03b0a-8082-47c0-ac65-43291f55e5d8_1974x248.png 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261018124643_6af03b0a-8082-47c0-ac65-43291f55e5d8_1974x248.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </figure>\n    </div>\n    <p><strong><a href=\"https://workos.com/lenny\">WorkOS</a></strong><span>—Make your app enterprise-ready, with SSO, SCIM, RBAC, and more</span></p>\n    <p><strong><a href=\"https://getdx.com/?utm_source=lenny&amp;utm_medium=sponsorship&amp;utm_campaign=q42026\">DX</a></strong><span>—Engineering intelligence for the AI era</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <h3 class=\"header-anchor-post\">Where to find Hector Serrano:\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\">\n      <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft iconButton-mq_Et5 iconButtonBase-dJGHgN buttonBase-GK1x3M buttonStyle-r7yGCK size_sm-G3LciD priority_secondary-S63h9o\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" data-href=\"https://www.lennysnewsletter.com/i/222540764/where-to-find-hector-serrano\"> \n       <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link\">\n        <path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path>\n       </svg> \n      </button>\n     </div>\n    </div></h3>\n   <p><span>• X: </span><a href=\"https://x.com/hectorserrranoo\">https://x.com/hectorserrranoo</a></p>\n   <p><span>• LinkedIn: </span><a href=\"http://linkedin.com/in/hector-serrano-martin\">linkedin.com/in/hector-serrano-martin</a></p>\n   <p><span>• YouTube: </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@hectorchats\">https://www.youtube.com/@hectorchats</a></p>\n   <h3 class=\"header-anchor-post\">\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\">\n      <button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft iconButton-mq_Et5 iconButtonBase-dJGHgN buttonBase-GK1x3M butt